generic.returnConditions:
not used beyond a simple trial;
clean, unstained and undamaged;
complete, with any accessories;
returned in the original packaging and suitable protective packaging.

generic.packingInstructions:
include your order number inside the parcel;
return the item with its accessories and original packaging where available;
use suitable protective packaging;
do not attach the shipping label directly to the original packaging;
email us proof of dispatch, such as a posting receipt or tracking number.

generic.rejectionReasons:
used excessively;
stained or damaged;
incomplete or missing supplied accessories;
insufficiently protected during return shipping;
in a condition preventing resale.

generic.excludedProducts:
gift cards;
made-to-measure items;
items clearly personalised to your requirements;
items modified specifically for you;
items returned in a condition preventing resale.

generic.exchangeOptions:
a different size;
a different colour;
the same item in another available variant.

shoes.returnConditions:
not worn outdoors;
tried on indoors only, on a clean surface;
clean;
unstained;
undamaged;
free of odours, excessive signs of use or visible wear;
with clean, unmarked soles;
complete, with any accessories;
returned in the original shoe box and packaging that adequately protects the product during transport.

shoes.packingInstructions:
include your order number inside the parcel;
return shoes in the original box where available;
place the original box in a suitable protective carton or package;
do not attach the shipping label directly to the shoe box;
email us proof of dispatch, such as a posting receipt or tracking number.

shoes.rejectionReasons:
worn outdoors;
used excessively;
stained;
damaged;
with marked, dirty or worn soles;
with abnormal creases, marks or deformation;
incomplete;
missing supplied accessories;
insufficiently protected during return shipping;
in a condition preventing resale.

shoes.excludedProducts:
gift cards;
made-to-measure items;
items clearly personalised to your requirements;
items modified specifically for you;
items returned in a condition preventing resale, particularly shoes worn outdoors or showing obvious wear.

shoes.exchangeOptions:
a different shoe size;
a different colour;
the same item in another available variant.
